WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.264
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:16.534 --> 00:22.869
(Firefly Theater)

3
00:43.456 --> 00:47.392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

4
00:49.024 --> 00:52.608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

5
00:53.184 --> 00:55.520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

6
00:55.904 --> 00:58.656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

7
00:59.488 --> 01:02.080
♪I've seen this game before♪

8
01:02.080 --> 01:04.768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

9
01:04.768 --> 01:07.168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

10
01:07.552 --> 01:10.304
♪Just an empty shell♪

11
01:10.624 --> 01:13.440
♪I've broken this game before♪

12
01:13.440 --> 01:15.872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

13
01:15.872 --> 01:18.016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

14
01:18.208 --> 01:25.056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

15
01:25.728 --> 01:28.256
♪When I stand back up again♪

16
01:28.544 --> 01:30.400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

17
01:31.264 --> 01:33.952
♪For the part you owe me♪

18
01:34.112 --> 01:41.088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

19
01:42.624 --> 01:47.360
♪You're just my starting point♪

20
01:51.712 --> 01:52.739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

21
01:53.128 --> 01:55.848
=Episode 2=

22
01:59.330 --> 01:59.851
Ma'am,

23
02:00.131 --> 02:00.851
is Mr. Di here?

24
02:00.931 --> 02:02.011
An urgent document needs

25
02:02.011 --> 02:03.011
his signature tonight.

26
02:03.090 --> 02:03.851
But he didn't reply

27
02:03.851 --> 02:04.500
to my message.

28
02:07.530 --> 02:08.291
(Honey,)

29
02:08.770 --> 02:10.131
Right now in my heart,

30
02:10.330 --> 02:11.842
you're Jiangzhou's most handsome man.

31
02:12.930 --> 02:13.691
Check the wind.

32
02:14.091 --> 02:15.610
Adjust our altitude in advance.

33
02:16.050 --> 02:16.691
Do you like

34
02:16.691 --> 02:17.851
looking down on the city?

35
02:19.770 --> 02:21.531
But I like seeing you change yourself

36
02:22.131 --> 02:23.371
for me even more.

37
02:23.730 --> 02:24.450
Thank you, honey.

38
02:25.450 --> 02:26.291
Thank you too,

39
02:28.011 --> 02:29.770
(Wen Xiaoxiao, Jiangzhou Airspace Helicopter Club) Safety Officer Ms. Wen.

40
02:31.770 --> 02:32.394
You're welcome.

41
02:56.851 --> 02:57.571
(By the way,)

42
02:57.610 --> 02:59.170
(you need to find out the mistress.)

43
02:59.251 --> 03:00.610
(Words can lie,)

44
03:00.811 --> 03:01.753
(but scents never do.)

45
03:03.811 --> 03:04.490
Are you okay?

46
03:10.811 --> 03:11.251
Thank you.

47
03:15.011 --> 03:15.924
You're from Jiali too?

48
03:16.411 --> 03:17.291
I'm in accounting.

49
03:17.371 --> 03:18.330
Helicopter training

50
03:18.371 --> 03:19.170
is just my side gig.

51
03:20.450 --> 03:21.802
I remember your last name is Wen.

52
03:21.930 --> 03:22.490
Wen Xiaoxiao.

53
03:29.291 --> 03:30.371
Weng Yue, please come in.

54
03:30.610 --> 03:31.011
Okay.

55
04:11.050 --> 04:12.490
It's your wife's lipstick.

56
04:13.930 --> 04:14.490
Good on me?

57
04:42.568 --> 04:44.107
(Wen Xiaoxiao Jiangzhou Airspace Helicopter Club)

58
04:45.611 --> 04:46.491
Do you have a cold?

59
04:48.731 --> 04:49.530
Not a cold.

60
04:49.970 --> 04:51.890
My husband used an essential oil lately.

61
04:52.011 --> 04:53.095
It set off my allergies.

62
04:54.850 --> 04:56.171
What a coincidence, Ms. Wen.

63
04:59.051 --> 05:00.090
You wear the same scent.

64
05:01.890 --> 05:02.970
Since we work in beauty,

65
05:03.171 --> 05:04.491
we always test new products.

66
05:05.530 --> 05:07.011
I often share scents with colleagues.

67
05:10.210 --> 05:11.731
On our anniversary,

68
05:11.931 --> 05:13.330
watching fireworks from a chopper

69
05:14.051 --> 05:15.450
was your idea for Liren, right?

70
05:16.811 --> 05:17.290
No.

71
05:17.650 --> 05:18.691
It was Mr. Di's own idea.

72
05:19.371 --> 05:20.330
I just happened to be

73
05:20.330 --> 05:21.450
at the flight club,

74
05:21.931 --> 05:22.931
so I gave him

75
05:23.051 --> 05:24.410
a few past examples.

76
05:24.731 --> 05:27.051
You do two jobs, Ms. Wen?

77
05:27.371 --> 05:28.650
You must work late often.

78
05:28.850 --> 05:30.330
No wonder you look a bit pale.

79
05:31.210 --> 05:32.090
How about this?

80
05:32.491 --> 05:33.770
I have a lipstick with a shade

81
05:33.970 --> 05:34.970
that'd look great on you.

82
05:35.210 --> 05:36.262
I'll give it to you later.

83
05:37.330 --> 05:37.770
Thank you.

84
05:38.611 --> 05:39.770
I actually had one before,

85
05:40.131 --> 05:41.731
but I threw it away.

86
05:42.371 --> 05:43.210
Do you know why?

87
05:43.491 --> 05:44.131
Why?

88
05:45.011 --> 05:45.450
Honey,

89
05:47.090 --> 05:48.210
what are you talking about?

90
05:49.530 --> 05:50.410
Honey,

91
05:50.931 --> 05:52.571
I was just asking Ms. Wen

92
05:52.611 --> 05:54.090
if you're harsh with your staff.

93
05:54.210 --> 05:55.051
Now that you're here,

94
05:55.371 --> 05:56.691
she's too intimidated to speak.

95
05:57.611 --> 05:59.611
Don't you know whether I'm harsh or not?

96
06:01.171 --> 06:02.491
What if you're just acting

97
06:02.530 --> 06:03.251
in front of me?

98
06:05.090 --> 06:06.011
Okay, let's drop it.

99
06:06.131 --> 06:06.770
Ms. Wen,

100
06:07.171 --> 06:08.131
grab some food.

101
06:09.171 --> 06:10.731
These are salmon rolls.

102
06:10.970 --> 06:11.691
And these are

103
06:11.731 --> 06:12.890
smoked salmon tartares.

104
06:14.290 --> 06:14.770
Honey,

105
06:15.290 --> 06:16.210
I just realized

106
06:16.931 --> 06:18.530
you're serving one fish two ways.

107
06:21.410 --> 06:22.143
Mr. Dong is here.

108
06:22.491 --> 06:23.371
Let's go say hello.

109
06:23.811 --> 06:24.371
Just a second.

110
06:25.970 --> 06:26.611
Ms. Wen,

111
06:26.850 --> 06:27.811
a friend of mine

112
06:28.011 --> 06:29.090
wants to learn to fly too.

113
06:29.811 --> 06:30.731
Let's add each other.

114
06:42.051 --> 06:43.155
I have a trial lesson today.

115
06:44.410 --> 06:45.870
This lady has been waiting a while.

116
06:46.131 --> 06:47.419
She booked a one-on-one lesson.

117
06:59.290 --> 07:00.770
You have to memorize so many buttons'

118
07:00.890 --> 07:02.051
locations and functions.

119
07:02.210 --> 07:03.611
Ms. Wen, your management skills

120
07:03.691 --> 07:04.691
must be top-notch.

121
07:05.090 --> 07:06.171
However complex a machine is,

122
07:06.171 --> 07:07.491
its underlying logic is fixed.

123
07:08.530 --> 07:10.290
Compared to coworkers who smile to your face

124
07:10.530 --> 07:11.770
while hiding

125
07:11.770 --> 07:12.850
their real thoughts,

126
07:13.251 --> 07:13.956
it's way simpler.

127
07:16.011 --> 07:17.366
Do you have a boyfriend, Ms. Wen?

128
07:18.931 --> 07:19.371
Yes.

129
07:20.410 --> 07:21.131
But he's married.

130
07:21.970 --> 07:23.571
I didn't expect you to have

131
07:23.931 --> 07:24.811
such a unique taste.

132
07:25.931 --> 07:27.131
Aside from his status,

133
07:27.530 --> 07:28.770
he's just an ordinary man.

134
07:30.530 --> 07:31.691
My taste and yours

135
07:33.011 --> 07:33.931
aren't that different.

136
07:34.970 --> 07:36.530
I bet he promised

137
07:38.931 --> 07:40.131
he'd get a divorce for you.

138
07:46.770 --> 07:48.051
Of course not, Meng.

139
07:48.931 --> 07:49.691
Don't scare me.

140
07:51.090 --> 07:52.131
In my opinion,

141
07:52.571 --> 07:53.890
being someone's girlfriend

142
07:54.691 --> 07:56.330
and working for a company

143
07:56.650 --> 07:58.210
are essentially the same.

144
07:59.251 --> 08:00.650
You don't want to replace his wife

145
08:01.051 --> 08:02.650
or want any legal

146
08:03.131 --> 08:04.571
or moral commitment?

147
08:05.251 --> 08:05.931
Meng,

148
08:06.650 --> 08:07.571
do you really believe

149
08:07.731 --> 08:08.890
a man's promises?

150
08:09.530 --> 08:10.571
Then what are you after?

151
08:11.611 --> 08:12.090
True love?

152
08:13.090 --> 08:13.571
Thrills?

153
08:16.290 --> 08:16.931
A career move.

154
08:19.371 --> 08:20.090
You want money?

155
08:20.410 --> 08:21.090
Not money.

156
08:21.691 --> 08:22.371
But resources.

157
08:23.450 --> 08:24.890
Money is just currency.

158
08:25.251 --> 08:26.890
People are stepping stones.

159
08:28.371 --> 08:29.491
Unlike a woman like you,

160
08:29.611 --> 08:31.131
who was born lucky,

161
08:31.330 --> 08:33.371
I can't afford some romantic fairy tale

162
08:33.491 --> 08:34.251
where you

163
08:34.331 --> 08:35.331
risk everything for love.

164
08:36.050 --> 08:37.810
I only have two cards to play:

165
08:39.091 --> 08:40.731
youth and beauty.

166
08:40.971 --> 08:42.131
So while I'm still

167
08:42.331 --> 08:43.451
at the table,

168
08:43.971 --> 08:46.011
I have to play them well.

169
08:55.410 --> 08:57.331
Ms. Wen is a skilled pilot.

170
08:57.770 --> 08:58.611
Even in turbulence,

171
08:58.770 --> 08:59.810
she stays calm.

172
09:00.290 --> 09:00.930
I like her.

173
09:01.211 --> 09:02.410
Can she be my

174
09:02.491 --> 09:03.650
exclusive flight instructor?

175
09:03.770 --> 09:04.410
Of course.

176
09:05.971 --> 09:06.971
But

177
09:06.971 --> 09:08.251
something urgent came up today.

178
09:08.331 --> 09:09.131
I have to go abroad.

179
09:09.131 --> 09:10.971
I might be back in a week,

180
09:11.050 --> 09:13.011
or it could take a month.

181
09:13.491 --> 09:14.371
During this time,

182
09:14.690 --> 09:15.491
can you not assign her

183
09:15.491 --> 09:16.251
any other students?

184
09:18.091 --> 09:18.331
Wait.

185
09:18.851 --> 09:19.331
Well...

186
09:19.690 --> 09:20.451
I can pay for that.

187
09:20.451 --> 09:21.131
No problem.

188
09:21.690 --> 09:23.131
We'll make sure Ms. Wen

189
09:23.570 --> 09:24.731
is at your disposal anytime.

190
09:26.690 --> 09:28.170
I want to learn

191
09:28.211 --> 09:29.091
all about Ms. Wen's

192
09:29.690 --> 09:30.690
management skills.

193
09:33.211 --> 09:33.851
But if she never

194
09:33.890 --> 09:34.731
shows up for class,

195
09:34.810 --> 09:35.491
the fees will sit

196
09:35.491 --> 09:36.371
in the club's account.

197
09:36.410 --> 09:37.131
(You'll see Jiangzhou like never before) I won't get paid,

198
09:37.131 --> 09:38.251
nor can I have new students.

199
09:38.331 --> 09:39.611
Who's covering my lost income?

200
09:41.451 --> 09:42.371
Didn't she say?

201
09:42.611 --> 09:43.451
She's going abroad

202
09:43.530 --> 09:44.690
and will be back for classes.

203
09:44.851 --> 09:45.611
Those are excuses.

204
09:45.650 --> 09:46.170
She's never

205
09:46.211 --> 09:46.971
coming back.

206
09:47.170 --> 09:48.011
How would you know?

207
09:48.650 --> 09:49.331
By your logic,

208
09:49.810 --> 09:50.851
she paid all that money

209
09:50.851 --> 09:51.530
for no classes

210
09:51.650 --> 09:52.731
just to block your schedule

211
09:52.731 --> 09:53.611
and mess with you?

212
09:54.011 --> 09:54.971
What's in it for her?

213
10:03.784 --> 10:05.224
(Add Visibility)

214
10:05.384 --> 10:06.504
(Select Friends Who Can See Yu Meng)

215
10:06.984 --> 10:08.840
I have a business trip next week. Be good.

216
10:19.930 --> 10:20.570
Mr. Jiao,

217
10:21.091 --> 10:22.211
what are you shooting here?

218
10:24.091 --> 10:24.650
You're here.

219
10:26.971 --> 10:28.170
You knew I was coming?

220
10:33.091 --> 10:34.731
Your assistant leaked

221
10:34.770 --> 10:36.131
his direct boss's schedule.

222
10:36.491 --> 10:37.770
You haven't trained him well.

223
10:38.011 --> 10:38.770
On the contrary,

224
10:39.050 --> 10:40.371
he executed the task

225
10:40.371 --> 10:41.331
I gave him perfectly.

226
10:41.731 --> 10:43.211
So you had him tell me

227
10:43.491 --> 10:44.211
where you'd be?

228
10:45.050 --> 10:45.731
I thought

229
10:46.011 --> 10:46.971
you should see

230
10:46.971 --> 10:47.973
my professional skills.

231
10:49.650 --> 10:50.251
That lady

232
10:50.251 --> 10:51.251
is my client.

233
10:52.211 --> 10:53.211
She and her husband

234
10:53.251 --> 10:54.322
are negotiating a divorce.

235
10:54.810 --> 10:56.371
The husband's lawyer claims

236
10:56.371 --> 10:57.582
the marriage is irreparable.

237
10:57.890 --> 10:58.890
But my client still

238
10:58.890 --> 10:59.650
needs more time

239
10:59.650 --> 11:01.091
to fight for child custody.

240
11:01.410 --> 11:01.810
So

241
11:02.170 --> 11:03.530
I had her invite her husband out

242
11:03.611 --> 11:04.731
in their child's name

243
11:04.930 --> 11:06.611
and put a box of Mid-Autumn

244
11:06.690 --> 11:07.451
mooncake gift sets

245
11:07.491 --> 11:08.770
in his trunk.

246
11:09.331 --> 11:10.170
It proves they still

247
11:10.251 --> 11:11.011
have feelings.

248
11:11.491 --> 11:13.611
But once a man's heart strays,

249
11:14.050 --> 11:15.611
even if she fights the divorce,

250
11:16.251 --> 11:17.211
what's the point?

251
11:17.491 --> 11:18.211
You misunderstand.

252
11:18.851 --> 11:19.971
She wants the divorce.

253
11:20.570 --> 11:21.930
Her ten-year-younger boyfriend

254
11:21.930 --> 11:23.211
keeps pushing her every day.

255
11:23.611 --> 11:24.611
He can't wait.

256
11:25.050 --> 11:25.930
Her boyfriend?

257
11:28.690 --> 11:29.650
So she cheated?

258
11:31.371 --> 11:31.930
And you're helping her?

259
11:31.930 --> 11:32.611
I know very well

260
11:32.611 --> 11:33.690
what you've been up to.

261
11:34.170 --> 11:35.331
You're blaming me?

262
11:35.530 --> 11:36.290
You put on a persona

263
11:36.290 --> 11:37.251
before marrying me.

264
11:37.611 --> 11:39.011
Don't change the subject.

265
11:39.011 --> 11:40.050
We're talking about you.

266
11:40.410 --> 11:41.251
Looks like I struck

267
11:41.251 --> 11:42.050
a nerve.

268
11:42.650 --> 11:43.451
You've been

269
11:43.451 --> 11:44.650
a hypocrite to the core.

270
11:44.851 --> 11:45.770
I'm a hypocrite?

271
11:45.971 --> 11:47.290
At least I'm not the one

272
11:47.331 --> 11:48.050
cheating around.

273
11:48.131 --> 11:49.170
You disgust me.

274
11:49.611 --> 11:50.344
- See? - I disgust you?

275
11:50.971 --> 11:51.851
Once a couple

276
11:51.851 --> 11:52.890
reaches the divorce stage,

277
11:53.290 --> 11:55.283
it's not because they don't understand each other,

278
11:55.731 --> 11:57.131
but rather because

279
11:57.530 --> 11:58.731
they finally do.

280
12:02.251 --> 12:03.331
No wonder your law firm

281
12:03.371 --> 12:04.290
recommended you,

282
12:04.371 --> 12:05.690
calling you the most professional

283
12:05.690 --> 12:06.451
top lawyer.

284
12:07.611 --> 12:08.851
Turns out they meant

285
12:08.930 --> 12:10.131
you're the top expert

286
12:10.570 --> 12:11.611
in low morals

287
12:11.650 --> 12:12.851
and twisted sophistry.

288
12:13.770 --> 12:14.971
I have high morals.

289
12:15.410 --> 12:16.451
My moral baseline

290
12:16.530 --> 12:18.050
is serving my clients

291
12:18.091 --> 12:18.890
unconditionally.

292
12:19.752 --> 12:20.680
(I'm Jiao Xu. Call me for your divorce. You need to find out the mistress.)

293
12:20.810 --> 12:21.451
(Words can lie, but scents never do.) Does this still stand?

294
12:22.451 --> 12:22.930
Of course.

295
12:24.011 --> 12:25.170
But let me be clear up front:

296
12:25.491 --> 12:26.170
I'm expensive.

297
12:26.570 --> 12:27.371
It sounds like

298
12:27.570 --> 12:29.211
your main goal isn't divorce, Ms. Yu.

299
12:30.890 --> 12:32.410
I want you to secure proof

300
12:32.491 --> 12:33.371
of his cheating first.

301
12:33.530 --> 12:34.770
Then we'll discuss the divorce.

302
12:34.890 --> 12:35.611
Ms. Yu,

303
12:36.331 --> 12:37.810
I sympathize with your situation,

304
12:38.011 --> 12:38.690
but I only handle

305
12:38.731 --> 12:39.570
things in court.

306
12:40.410 --> 12:41.650
The fee I'm offering

307
12:41.890 --> 12:43.611
is twice your usual rate.

308
12:52.211 --> 12:52.810
Three times.

309
12:54.810 --> 12:55.530
Four times.

310
12:58.170 --> 12:59.371
I've seen men

311
12:59.611 --> 13:01.251
marry for their father-in-law the first time

312
13:01.251 --> 13:02.422
and for true love the second.

313
13:02.690 --> 13:03.410
Rest assured,

314
13:03.770 --> 13:05.451
I have plenty of relevant experience.

315
13:07.131 --> 13:08.211
Then I'm counting on you.

316
13:11.371 --> 13:12.211
From what you said,

317
13:12.251 --> 13:12.851
your husband

318
13:12.851 --> 13:14.050
has been cheating for a while.

319
13:14.570 --> 13:15.491
The other woman knows

320
13:15.491 --> 13:16.371
he's married,

321
13:16.410 --> 13:17.371
yet she still boldly

322
13:17.410 --> 13:18.570
shows up in front of you.

323
13:18.690 --> 13:19.371
That shows

324
13:19.890 --> 13:21.170
their relationship is stable.

325
13:21.930 --> 13:22.611
So morning jogs

326
13:23.091 --> 13:23.890
might be their

327
13:23.890 --> 13:25.251
tacitly agreed rendezvous time.

328
13:25.331 --> 13:26.011
Mr. Jiao,

329
13:26.451 --> 13:28.050
I'm paying you four times your rate.

330
13:28.211 --> 13:28.930
Can you tell me

331
13:28.971 --> 13:30.050
something of actual value?

332
13:30.371 --> 13:31.731
I already know all of this.

333
13:32.290 --> 13:34.170
Think back on his recent behavior.

334
13:34.451 --> 13:35.570
Has he randomly bought you

335
13:35.650 --> 13:36.611
expensive gifts

336
13:36.650 --> 13:38.251
or made passionate confessions of love?

337
13:38.770 --> 13:39.371
Maybe that's

338
13:39.371 --> 13:40.371
guilt from cheating.

339
13:41.211 --> 13:42.650
We've always been happy together.

340
13:43.491 --> 13:43.930
No,

341
13:44.451 --> 13:45.331
rather,

342
13:45.971 --> 13:47.371
I thought we'd been happy together.

343
13:47.971 --> 13:49.371
He tells me he loves me every day

344
13:49.611 --> 13:50.851
and always gives me gifts.

345
13:51.290 --> 13:53.131
So what you mentioned

346
13:53.451 --> 13:54.410
might not apply at all.

347
13:54.650 --> 13:55.930
So your social media posts

348
13:56.011 --> 13:57.011
are all real?

349
13:58.930 --> 14:00.050
I thought it was a persona.

350
14:00.371 --> 14:01.690
I used to truly believe

351
14:02.011 --> 14:02.731
I was just

352
14:02.731 --> 14:03.971
a woman born lucky.

353
14:05.251 --> 14:06.251
But this very persona

354
14:06.331 --> 14:07.011
made me spiral

355
14:07.290 --> 14:08.290
step-by-step

356
14:08.690 --> 14:10.211
into where I am today.

357
14:10.810 --> 14:11.770
The "born lucky" label

358
14:11.851 --> 14:13.050
is indeed deceptive.

359
14:13.731 --> 14:15.690
It makes you mistake your own abilities

360
14:15.770 --> 14:17.251
for sheer luck.

361
14:18.050 --> 14:18.530
But

362
14:20.211 --> 14:21.971
when life takes a turn,

363
14:22.050 --> 14:23.211
and you wake up

364
14:23.211 --> 14:24.530
and bravely walk out of an abyss,

365
14:25.170 --> 14:26.050
how is that not

366
14:26.091 --> 14:26.851
good luck too?

367
14:28.851 --> 14:30.011
That makes some sense.

368
14:31.371 --> 14:32.650
I thought you were

369
14:32.731 --> 14:33.890
a refined scoundrel,

370
14:34.530 --> 14:36.011
but turns out you're...

371
14:37.810 --> 14:38.930
What's that word again?

372
14:39.011 --> 14:39.764
Overly brilliant?

373
14:40.930 --> 14:41.971
Dashing and charming?

374
14:43.211 --> 14:44.611
Gentle and refined?

375
14:44.770 --> 14:45.578
A woman's best ally.

376
14:48.290 --> 14:48.851
Mr. Jiao,

377
14:49.410 --> 14:50.331
one last question.

378
14:50.890 --> 14:51.770
If I gather

379
14:51.851 --> 14:53.290
all the evidence of his cheating,

380
14:54.251 --> 14:55.371
can he be left with nothing?

381
14:56.650 --> 14:56.971
No.

382
14:57.611 --> 14:58.491
The at-fault party

383
14:58.570 --> 14:59.530
gets a smaller share

384
14:59.530 --> 15:00.731
but not zero during division.

385
15:01.170 --> 15:01.570
Also,

386
15:01.690 --> 15:02.731
if the assets you mean

387
15:02.810 --> 15:04.251
include your family's company,

388
15:04.770 --> 15:05.650
it's more complicated.

389
15:06.290 --> 15:07.770
But he doesn't own anything.

390
15:08.331 --> 15:09.650
All our family company shares

391
15:09.890 --> 15:10.731
are held by my dad.

392
15:11.731 --> 15:12.690
Speaking of which,

393
15:15.131 --> 15:16.410
how is your father's

394
15:16.971 --> 15:17.570
health?

395
15:18.770 --> 15:19.570
He's doing great.

396
15:20.451 --> 15:20.890
Why?

397
15:21.890 --> 15:23.251
Then what about your lock screen?

398
15:24.616 --> 15:25.896
(Long Life for Dad)

399
15:27.451 --> 15:28.530
I just don't want

400
15:29.211 --> 15:29.851
to hustle.

401
15:30.331 --> 15:32.011
I hope my dad lives to a hundred,

402
15:32.251 --> 15:33.371
so I can just coast.

403
15:35.690 --> 15:36.851
An ambitious dream.

404
15:37.211 --> 15:37.890
Mr. Jiao,

405
15:38.290 --> 15:39.650
can you actually help me or not?

406
15:40.050 --> 15:41.131
What are my chances?

407
15:42.971 --> 15:44.251
Considering you've been detached

408
15:44.290 --> 15:45.851
from company operations for so long

409
15:45.971 --> 15:46.491
and have no control

410
15:46.491 --> 15:47.662
over the household finances,

411
15:48.211 --> 15:48.930
to be honest,

412
15:49.690 --> 15:50.676
your chances are slim.

413
15:53.371 --> 15:53.770
But

414
15:54.930 --> 15:55.890
that's also why

415
15:55.890 --> 15:56.930
I took this case.

416
15:57.611 --> 15:59.091
I hate anything too easy.

417
16:00.050 --> 16:00.770
Ms. Yu,

418
16:01.371 --> 16:02.331
divorce is

419
16:02.331 --> 16:03.810
a bloodless war of human nature.

420
16:05.011 --> 16:06.091
Are you ready to fight it?

421
16:08.232 --> 16:09.288
(Wen Xiaoxiao)

422
16:09.800 --> 16:10.376
(Dongji Island Feel the free romance at 30° N)

423
16:15.091 --> 16:16.410
Meng, did you go on a trip?

424
16:19.211 --> 16:19.770
No.

425
16:20.131 --> 16:20.690
(Dongji Island) Someone else posted it.

426
16:21.451 --> 16:22.690
I wanted to go to Dongji Island too.

427
16:22.690 --> 16:23.679
I thought you went there

428
16:23.890 --> 16:25.091
and was going to ask

429
16:25.091 --> 16:25.690
how it was.

430
16:26.971 --> 16:27.851
(Honey,)

431
16:29.170 --> 16:30.570
where are you heading this time?

432
16:31.971 --> 16:32.690
Dongji Island.

433
16:32.971 --> 16:33.770
With a few clients.

434
16:35.131 --> 16:36.011
That far?

435
16:40.451 --> 16:41.890
Take me with you.

436
16:43.930 --> 16:44.690
The forecast says

437
16:44.770 --> 16:45.810
it's been raining there.

438
16:46.690 --> 16:47.530
If you go,

439
16:47.971 --> 16:49.371
you'll have to bundle up tight.

440
16:50.410 --> 16:51.251
Then I won't go.

441
17:01.251 --> 17:02.251
Why pack a camera?

442
17:02.890 --> 17:03.971
You rarely bring a camera

443
17:03.971 --> 17:04.530
for business.

444
17:04.971 --> 17:06.171
One client's hobby

445
17:06.251 --> 17:06.971
is photography.

446
17:07.330 --> 17:08.891
I borrowed it from Dad especially,

447
17:09.850 --> 17:11.090
thinking a shared hobby

448
17:11.491 --> 17:12.290
would break the ice.

449
17:13.770 --> 17:14.691
Then your first photo

450
17:14.731 --> 17:15.931
has to be of me.

451
17:16.731 --> 17:17.451
Take one of me.

452
17:34.251 --> 17:35.411
Dad, Mom,

453
17:35.810 --> 17:36.691
I'm back.

454
17:37.411 --> 17:38.090
- Meng. - Mom.

455
17:39.451 --> 17:39.931
Ms. Hui.

456
17:40.330 --> 17:41.130
It's Thursday.

457
17:41.171 --> 17:42.651
There's a Wuqinxi class this afternoon.

458
17:42.651 --> 17:43.491
They went to it.

459
17:44.251 --> 17:45.370
Will you stay for dinner?

460
17:45.451 --> 17:45.931
I'll make

461
17:45.971 --> 17:46.691
your favorite

462
17:46.731 --> 17:47.597
duck soup with bamboo shoots.

463
17:48.411 --> 17:49.130
Thanks, Ms. Hui.

464
17:49.610 --> 17:50.810
I want to take a nap first.

465
17:51.090 --> 17:52.770
I'll eat when I wake up.

466
17:52.850 --> 17:53.486
Don't wake me.

467
17:55.651 --> 17:56.891
You're napping in the study?

468
17:57.451 --> 17:58.330
I put fresh sheets

469
17:58.370 --> 17:59.411
on your bed.

470
18:01.651 --> 18:02.570
The study is sunny.

471
18:02.810 --> 18:03.691
It's cozier there.

472
18:28.370 --> 18:28.891
Mr. Di,

473
18:29.090 --> 18:29.810
you're here too?

474
18:30.240 --> 18:30.770
Should I make

475
18:30.770 --> 18:31.610
your dinner as well?

476
18:32.491 --> 18:33.090
Is Meng here?

477
18:33.570 --> 18:34.130
She just came,

478
18:34.370 --> 18:35.171
right before you.

479
18:37.651 --> 18:39.130
Meng is sleeping in the study.

480
18:39.731 --> 18:40.290
She was tried

481
18:40.411 --> 18:41.370
and specifically said

482
18:41.570 --> 18:42.211
not to wake her.

483
18:42.570 --> 18:43.530
Sleeping in the study?

484
18:45.931 --> 18:46.691
That won't do.

485
18:48.691 --> 18:50.411
I'll go check so she doesn't catch a chill.

486
19:07.971 --> 19:09.731
No portraits, only scenery shots.

487
19:10.491 --> 19:11.691
People usually take photos

488
19:12.011 --> 19:13.251
with clients, right?

489
19:13.491 --> 19:14.570
Even if they were terrible,

490
19:14.570 --> 19:15.769
he wouldn't delete them all.

491
19:16.011 --> 19:16.971
This is so strange.

492
19:23.171 --> 19:23.610
Mr. Di,

493
19:24.011 --> 19:25.644
Meng wanted duck soup with bamboo shoots.

494
19:25.850 --> 19:27.050
I'll add some cordyceps.

495
19:27.251 --> 19:28.017
Will you have some?

496
19:34.411 --> 19:36.731
Honey, what are you talking about?

497
19:36.850 --> 19:38.011
You woke me up.

498
19:38.651 --> 19:39.491
My fault.

499
19:40.011 --> 19:41.130
I brought you a blanket

500
19:41.171 --> 19:42.113
in case you got cold.

501
19:45.411 --> 19:46.850
I'm up anyway.

502
19:47.050 --> 19:47.885
Let's go upstairs.

503
19:48.651 --> 19:49.011
Okay.

504
20:06.728 --> 20:08.008
(Boya Center)

505
20:19.731 --> 20:20.211
Sorry,

506
20:20.211 --> 20:21.211
I thought it was my ride.

507
20:22.050 --> 20:23.011
Since you're here,

508
20:23.570 --> 20:24.330
let me drive you.

509
20:28.810 --> 20:29.610
Thanks, Meng.

510
20:35.090 --> 20:36.246
Did you enjoy Dongji Island?

511
20:36.850 --> 20:37.370
It was great.

512
20:41.691 --> 20:43.090
I heard Dongji Island

513
20:43.370 --> 20:44.850
is a place you go with a partner.

514
20:45.130 --> 20:45.939
Were you with yours?

515
20:46.770 --> 20:47.211
Yes.

516
20:48.090 --> 20:48.691
Ms. Wen,

517
20:49.570 --> 20:50.651
what does it feel like

518
20:50.731 --> 20:51.610
to date a married man?

519
20:52.491 --> 20:52.891
What did

520
20:52.891 --> 20:53.810
he say about his wife?

521
20:54.731 --> 20:55.370
He said

522
20:55.891 --> 20:57.090
they've been deeply in love.

523
20:57.891 --> 20:59.130
Then I understand even less.

524
21:00.610 --> 21:02.109
Don't you worry that she'll find out?

525
21:04.330 --> 21:05.251
I'd waited for her

526
21:05.290 --> 21:06.090
to come to me.

527
21:06.850 --> 21:07.491
And today,

528
21:10.570 --> 21:11.211
she did.

529
21:14.451 --> 21:15.850
So that Moments post

530
21:16.651 --> 21:17.810
was intentional?

531
21:18.731 --> 21:20.090
It was to show my sincerity.

532
21:20.491 --> 21:21.451
You wanted to lure me out

533
21:21.451 --> 21:22.405
and force a showdown?

534
21:24.810 --> 21:25.971
I wanted to apologize to you,

535
21:25.971 --> 21:26.491
Meng.

536
21:28.090 --> 21:29.530
I followed your social media

537
21:31.330 --> 21:32.330
and looked at your posts.

538
21:32.610 --> 21:33.691
I know you love Mr. Di

539
21:34.251 --> 21:35.731
and what I did must have hurt you.

540
21:36.451 --> 21:37.411
But I want to say,

541
21:38.171 --> 21:39.330
when a man cheats,

542
21:40.370 --> 21:41.290
even if it weren't me,

543
21:41.891 --> 21:42.829
it'd be someone else.

544
21:44.011 --> 21:44.691
At least

545
21:46.530 --> 21:47.563
I don't want your place.

546
21:48.290 --> 21:49.171
Ms. Wen,

547
21:49.451 --> 21:50.971
are you implying

548
21:51.530 --> 21:52.651
I should thank you?

549
21:52.971 --> 21:54.050
I want to thank you.

550
21:58.891 --> 21:59.330
Let me

551
21:59.330 --> 22:00.330
treat you to dinner.

552
22:18.370 --> 22:19.491
Let me show you around.

553
22:19.971 --> 22:21.530
Some of these were bought by Mr. Di,

554
22:22.050 --> 22:22.810
so half is yours.

555
22:23.411 --> 22:23.931
Feel free.

556
22:54.090 --> 22:55.610
Not a single designer brand.

557
22:56.251 --> 22:57.090
Pure romance?

558
22:57.610 --> 22:58.731
At one point,

559
22:58.810 --> 23:00.067
I fancied designer brands too,

560
23:01.130 --> 23:02.570
but then I found them meaningless.

561
23:03.050 --> 23:03.669
So I sold them.

562
23:04.891 --> 23:06.011
Were your previous bosses

563
23:07.290 --> 23:08.570
other women's husbands too?

564
23:09.090 --> 23:09.530
Yes.

565
23:13.530 --> 23:14.850
Did Di Liren

566
23:15.691 --> 23:17.011
leave anything behind here?

567
23:21.651 --> 23:22.731
His only belonging here

568
23:26.530 --> 23:27.130
is this.

569
23:27.770 --> 23:28.971
Not even a piece of clothing?

570
23:29.850 --> 23:30.891
I know it's a lot to take,

571
23:31.810 --> 23:33.770
but the only thing here for him to wear

572
23:33.891 --> 23:34.570
is this.

573
23:35.251 --> 23:36.276
He never stays the night.

574
23:38.090 --> 23:39.651
He already wears this thing.

575
23:40.530 --> 23:41.731
Does that even matter?

576
23:42.050 --> 23:43.011
It's different.

577
23:44.411 --> 23:45.681
At least he cares about family.

578
23:46.251 --> 23:47.103
He's a good husband.

579
23:49.256 --> 23:51.720
(Honey)

580
23:52.171 --> 23:52.610
Hello?

581
23:53.290 --> 23:53.731
Honey,

582
23:54.171 --> 23:55.330
my work dinner was canceled.

583
23:55.691 --> 23:56.770
Mr. Liu's stomach acted up.

584
23:57.011 --> 23:57.850
I'm on my way home

585
23:58.171 --> 23:58.850
to take you out

586
23:58.891 --> 24:00.330
for your favorite Chaozhou food,

587
24:00.370 --> 24:00.731
okay?

588
24:01.810 --> 24:02.610
I've booked a table.

589
24:02.691 --> 24:04.050
No need. I have plans.

590
24:04.731 --> 24:05.370
Honey,

591
24:05.411 --> 24:07.050
we haven't had a date in days.

592
24:07.290 --> 24:08.570
Are you seeing someone else?

593
24:08.731 --> 24:09.290
Yeah.

594
24:09.691 --> 24:10.423
What will you do?

595
24:11.491 --> 24:12.731
Then it must be my fault.

596
24:13.050 --> 24:14.130
I upset you,

597
24:14.130 --> 24:15.264
pushing you to someone else.

598
24:16.171 --> 24:17.691
I know you love me most.

599
24:18.370 --> 24:19.810
You must be at Liu Zi's

600
24:19.850 --> 24:20.570
with Chestnut,

601
24:20.570 --> 24:20.971
right?

602
24:21.850 --> 24:22.530
When you're done,

603
24:22.651 --> 24:23.610
I'll pick you up.

604
24:24.931 --> 24:25.891
Liu Zi will drive me.

605
24:26.011 --> 24:26.891
I need to go.

606
24:29.211 --> 24:29.850
Let's eat.

607
24:34.451 --> 24:35.891
Does he know you asked me over

608
24:36.370 --> 24:37.011
for dinner?

609
24:37.411 --> 24:38.251
How could he know?

610
24:38.891 --> 24:40.211
I genuinely wanted to treat you

611
24:40.411 --> 24:41.130
to dinner.

612
24:45.850 --> 24:47.171
I usually order takeout,

613
24:47.651 --> 24:48.810
but I tell men

614
24:49.370 --> 24:50.090
I made it myself.

615
24:54.050 --> 24:55.931
With all these little tricks you play on men,

616
24:56.411 --> 24:57.130
it's no wonder.

617
24:57.530 --> 24:58.171
Aren't men just

618
24:58.570 --> 24:59.050
looking for

619
24:59.050 --> 25:00.050
emotional validation?

620
25:00.971 --> 25:01.810
As for the process,

621
25:02.491 --> 25:03.155
who truly cares?

622
25:03.610 --> 25:05.370
You invited me here.

623
25:05.810 --> 25:06.770
It wasn't just

624
25:07.011 --> 25:08.171
to treat me

625
25:08.211 --> 25:08.810
to some soup.

626
25:09.491 --> 25:10.050
Out with it.

627
25:11.290 --> 25:11.971
What do you want?

628
25:15.130 --> 25:16.171
I want a job offer letter.

629
25:17.770 --> 25:19.130
You mean

630
25:19.610 --> 25:21.090
you broke up my marriage,

631
25:21.211 --> 25:22.211
and now you want me

632
25:22.610 --> 25:23.850
to set you up with a job?

633
25:26.088 --> 25:27.624
(Nuisance Call)

634
25:35.011 --> 25:35.491
Babe,

635
25:36.090 --> 25:36.770
are you home?

636
25:37.130 --> 25:38.130
She went out tonight.

637
25:38.530 --> 25:39.491
I'm coming over now.

638
25:39.720 --> 25:40.552
(Nuisance Call)

639
25:40.810 --> 25:41.491
Should I let him?

640
25:42.330 --> 25:43.137
I do what you say.

641
25:49.011 --> 25:50.011
I'm out

642
25:51.731 --> 25:52.411
with a friend.

643
25:53.211 --> 25:53.651
Can I

644
25:53.651 --> 25:54.651
steal you away

645
25:54.691 --> 25:55.406
from your friend?

646
25:56.171 --> 25:57.130
No.

647
25:58.330 --> 25:58.971
If I gave in

648
25:58.971 --> 26:00.130
to your every whim,

649
26:00.691 --> 26:02.011
the thrill would be gone.

650
26:03.211 --> 26:03.691
Bye.

651
26:09.770 --> 26:10.530
I can tell.

652
26:13.090 --> 26:13.928
You love him a lot.

653
26:17.770 --> 26:18.451
Since

654
26:18.971 --> 26:20.330
you know how to handle him,

655
26:20.931 --> 26:21.971
why don't you just ask him

656
26:21.971 --> 26:22.610
for the offer?

657
26:22.971 --> 26:24.810
He has been feeding me empty promises.

658
26:25.370 --> 26:26.651
From the day we met,

659
26:26.810 --> 26:28.211
he promised me so much.

660
26:28.850 --> 26:30.130
But promises

661
26:30.530 --> 26:32.411
are just cheap talks.

662
26:33.451 --> 26:34.290
Who knows

663
26:34.651 --> 26:35.290
if he delivers?

664
26:36.610 --> 26:37.971
You distrust him that much?

665
26:40.610 --> 26:42.491
Has he kept all the promises

666
26:43.251 --> 26:44.011
he made to you?

667
26:45.171 --> 26:46.491
Then why should I believe

668
26:46.530 --> 26:47.651
the promises he made to me

669
26:47.931 --> 26:49.050
will ever come true?

670
26:49.891 --> 26:50.731
Since I now have

671
26:50.731 --> 26:51.651
a better choice,

672
26:53.290 --> 26:54.451
why not seize it?

673
26:57.651 --> 26:58.251
Forget it.

674
26:58.651 --> 26:59.850
After all that talk,

675
27:00.211 --> 27:01.411
I don't see any sincerity.

676
27:02.850 --> 27:03.891
It's pointless.

677
27:05.651 --> 27:06.731
Aren't you eating?

678
27:08.411 --> 27:08.810
Right.

679
27:09.651 --> 27:10.931
Think carefully

680
27:11.330 --> 27:12.810
about what you're trading with me.

681
27:13.651 --> 27:14.370
Bye.

682
27:30.731 --> 27:31.570
Why?

683
27:32.616 --> 27:41.320
(Five years ago, Xiaocheng)

684
27:46.330 --> 27:47.171
Are you all right?

685
27:50.610 --> 27:50.971
Here.

686
27:52.971 --> 27:53.370
Okay.

687
27:54.050 --> 27:54.850
I called the police

688
27:55.011 --> 27:55.850
and an ambulance.

689
27:56.411 --> 27:57.211
Thank you.

690
27:58.211 --> 27:59.370
What's your name?

691
27:59.411 --> 28:00.451
Stop! Don't run!

692
28:01.576 --> 28:06.280
♪If choices must be made♪

693
28:07.770 --> 28:08.605
(It's all my fault.)

694
28:09.931 --> 28:11.691
Why did I agree to let you visit the factory?

695
28:12.891 --> 28:13.850
It's just a raw material

696
28:13.891 --> 28:14.931
factory in Xiaocheng.

697
28:14.971 --> 28:15.810
What's there to see?

698
28:15.810 --> 28:16.290
Look at you,

699
28:16.971 --> 28:17.891
getting hurt like this.

700
28:18.050 --> 28:19.090
Did they catch the driver?

701
28:19.251 --> 28:20.370
I heard a kind man

702
28:20.411 --> 28:21.050
caught him

703
28:21.370 --> 28:22.610
and took him to the police.

704
28:23.330 --> 28:24.491
He seemed to be injured too.

705
28:25.330 --> 28:26.651
But he didn't leave a name.

706
28:26.691 --> 28:27.850
No one knows who he is.

707
28:31.610 --> 28:32.570
So noisy.

708
28:35.971 --> 28:36.810
So annoying.

709
28:42.810 --> 28:43.491
It's you.

710
28:45.850 --> 28:46.290
Hello.

711
28:47.130 --> 28:47.891
I'm Di Liren.

712
28:58.171 --> 28:59.050
I'm so sorry.

713
28:59.251 --> 29:00.691
You got hurt because you chased

714
29:00.971 --> 29:01.891
that driver.

715
29:03.891 --> 29:04.770
Justice was served.

716
29:05.090 --> 29:06.011
The injury is worth it.

717
29:07.691 --> 29:09.171
Since you won't go back to the ward,

718
29:09.651 --> 29:10.290
then

719
29:13.530 --> 29:14.611
let me take you somewhere.

720
29:15.290 --> 29:15.850
Where?

721
29:27.211 --> 29:28.530
I finally made it up.

722
29:29.011 --> 29:29.451
Three,

723
29:30.530 --> 29:31.050
two,

724
29:32.011 --> 29:32.370
one.

725
29:33.251 --> 29:33.610
Look.

726
29:38.050 --> 29:39.211
This is so gorgeous.

727
29:41.731 --> 29:42.891
Quick, over here.

728
29:43.491 --> 29:43.971
Stop!

729
29:44.570 --> 29:45.011
Don't run!

730
29:45.130 --> 29:45.530
Stop!

731
29:47.171 --> 29:47.810
I see you!

732
29:48.451 --> 29:49.067
Where are they?

733
29:49.891 --> 29:50.553
Where are they?

734
29:54.888 --> 29:58.408
♪I was never the clever one♪

735
29:58.632 --> 30:02.120
♪Just trying to live with heart♪

736
30:02.248 --> 30:08.104
♪To love, to hate, to seek a more genuine soul♪

737
30:08.264 --> 30:12.936
♪Some embrace while some turn cold♪

738
30:12.936 --> 30:18.568
♪The ones who stay are the sincerest♪

739
30:22.810 --> 30:24.651
If someone had told me a few days ago

740
30:25.971 --> 30:26.651
that I'd meet

741
30:26.691 --> 30:27.931
a wonderful girl

742
30:29.731 --> 30:30.731
at the cost of

743
30:31.411 --> 30:32.050
being injured,

744
30:32.931 --> 30:33.538
hospitalized,

745
30:34.251 --> 30:35.398
and falling behind at work,

746
30:36.171 --> 30:37.570
yet my heart would feel

747
30:37.610 --> 30:38.211
restless,

748
30:39.290 --> 30:39.931
concerned,

749
30:40.971 --> 30:41.570
and anxious,

750
30:43.011 --> 30:43.570
even if it were

751
30:43.570 --> 30:44.610
just a brief encounter,

752
30:45.050 --> 30:46.610
and we'd never meet again,

753
30:48.810 --> 30:49.411
I think

754
30:52.050 --> 30:53.451
I would make the same choice.

755
30:57.610 --> 30:58.171
Because this is

756
30:58.171 --> 30:59.411
a gift from heaven.

757
31:03.816 --> 31:11.048
♪We cannot let go♪

758
31:30.088 --> 31:33.768
♪I was never the clever one♪

759
31:33.768 --> 31:37.320
♪Just trying to live with heart♪

760
31:37.320 --> 31:43.400
♪To love, to hate, to seek a more genuine soul♪

761
31:43.560 --> 31:48.232
♪Some embrace while some turn cold♪

762
31:48.232 --> 31:53.768
♪The ones who stay are the sincerest♪

763
31:54.504 --> 32:01.416
♪We cannot let go♪

764
32:06.810 --> 32:08.330
Do you have anything to say to me?

765
32:11.971 --> 32:12.610
See you in Jiangzhou.

766
32:29.530 --> 32:30.211
Liar.

767
32:31.810 --> 32:33.290
Liar. Di Liren.

768
32:33.451 --> 32:34.570
You liar!

769
32:35.370 --> 32:36.171
You scumbag!

770
33:22.931 --> 33:23.570
Surprise!

771
33:24.651 --> 33:26.251
Three, two, one.

772
33:27.290 --> 33:28.011
Stop doing this.

773
33:28.610 --> 33:30.130
Cleaning up is such a hassle.

774
33:37.651 --> 33:38.090
Honey,

775
33:39.011 --> 33:40.516
happy anniversary of the day we met!

776
33:43.370 --> 33:44.770
I had terrible luck that day.

777
33:45.130 --> 33:46.330
I can't be happy about it.

778
33:46.971 --> 33:48.090
It was a rough day,

779
33:48.530 --> 33:49.770
but the ending was perfect.

780
33:50.171 --> 33:51.770
I remember you were in a car accident,

781
33:52.171 --> 33:53.290
and I got injured too.

782
33:55.451 --> 33:56.891
As two people wrapped in bandages,

783
33:57.011 --> 33:58.651
we couldn't even stay still in the ward.

784
33:59.411 --> 34:01.011
but ran to the factory at midnight.

785
34:01.770 --> 34:03.370
You looked at the stars and night view,

786
34:04.251 --> 34:04.891
while I

787
34:05.731 --> 34:06.971
only had eyes for you.

788
34:07.731 --> 34:09.491
I want to cherish and commemorate

789
34:09.650 --> 34:10.690
our first meeting forever.

790
34:17.851 --> 34:19.610
I saw you failed at making this earlier

791
34:19.891 --> 34:20.730
and seemed a bit sad.

792
34:21.130 --> 34:21.690
Now

793
34:22.050 --> 34:22.971
taste my cooking.

794
34:23.090 --> 34:23.931
I won't have any.

795
34:24.491 --> 34:25.596
I'm cutting back on sugar.

796
34:25.851 --> 34:26.491
Don't worry.

797
34:27.130 --> 34:28.299
I used a sugar substitute.

798
34:28.491 --> 34:29.451
You won't gain weight.

799
34:38.331 --> 34:38.851
Try some.

800
34:45.530 --> 34:45.971
How is it?

801
34:48.291 --> 34:48.971
Not good.

802
34:52.130 --> 34:53.610
That's strange.

803
34:56.050 --> 34:57.851
Which step did I mess up?

804
35:01.411 --> 35:02.371
Do you know

805
35:02.411 --> 35:03.931
where I went wrong

806
35:04.250 --> 35:05.291
when I made this dessert?

807
35:06.050 --> 35:06.690
Where?

808
35:08.050 --> 35:09.891
When I mixed the whipped egg whites

809
35:09.931 --> 35:11.170
with the yolks,

810
35:11.690 --> 35:12.610
I accidentally

811
35:13.130 --> 35:14.371
let in a third wheel.

812
35:17.291 --> 35:18.090
Water.

813
35:19.971 --> 35:21.610
I knocked over the cup without noticing

814
35:22.250 --> 35:23.291
and spilled some in.

815
35:26.491 --> 35:27.011
Honey,

816
35:27.730 --> 35:29.291
that's a humorous choice of words.

817
35:30.730 --> 35:32.610
Even pure water added in

818
35:33.130 --> 35:33.811
can ruin

819
35:33.851 --> 35:35.210
a simple dessert,

820
35:36.011 --> 35:37.210
let alone

821
35:37.811 --> 35:39.210
a complex relationship.

822
35:41.931 --> 35:42.771
You're right, honey.

823
35:43.530 --> 35:44.050
Honey,

824
35:45.931 --> 35:46.891
tell me.

825
35:47.931 --> 35:49.811
If a relationship is tainted

826
35:50.451 --> 35:51.811
by a third wheel,

827
35:52.730 --> 35:53.610
what should we do?

828
35:54.451 --> 35:55.291
In a relationship,

829
35:55.730 --> 35:56.971
there can't be a third wheel.

830
35:57.851 --> 35:58.411
But there are

831
35:59.331 --> 35:59.971
exceptions.

832
36:07.011 --> 36:07.491
Look.

833
36:10.491 --> 36:11.610
Guo Jun from Design

834
36:11.971 --> 36:13.371
shows off his son every day.

835
36:13.730 --> 36:15.570
He took annual leave these days

836
36:15.891 --> 36:16.891
and took his wife and kid

837
36:16.931 --> 36:17.610
to Sanya.

838
36:18.291 --> 36:18.811
His son

839
36:19.170 --> 36:20.250
is so attached to his mom.

840
36:20.771 --> 36:22.291
He won't let Guo Jun hold her hand.

841
36:22.891 --> 36:24.291
When I called him today, I joked,

842
36:24.650 --> 36:25.411
"You gave birth

843
36:25.451 --> 36:26.130
to a little

844
36:26.170 --> 36:27.210
third wheel."

845
36:29.210 --> 36:30.170
I was thinking,

846
36:30.210 --> 36:30.971
in the future,

847
36:31.050 --> 36:32.291
if we have a son,

848
36:32.931 --> 36:34.130
he'll be attached to you too.

849
36:34.570 --> 36:35.971
Sons take after their fathers.

850
36:36.891 --> 36:38.291
But I think you prefer daughters.

851
36:39.730 --> 36:40.451
Then

852
36:40.971 --> 36:42.011
we should make a wish

853
36:42.130 --> 36:43.130
to have a daughter.

854
36:46.690 --> 36:47.331
Give it to me.

855
36:48.331 --> 36:49.170
Did it spill on you?

856
36:49.210 --> 36:49.690
No.

857
36:50.371 --> 36:50.771
It's fine.

858
36:51.451 --> 36:52.250
I'll go change.

859
37:02.491 --> 37:03.050
Honey,

860
37:03.570 --> 37:05.050
what should I wear to work tomorrow?

861
37:28.291 --> 37:30.250
Don't touch me. I'm really tired.

862
37:30.451 --> 37:31.210
I'll sleep here.

863
37:31.530 --> 37:32.291
No,

864
37:32.811 --> 37:33.851
you'll catch a cold here.

865
37:34.170 --> 37:34.491
Come on.

866
37:37.771 --> 37:38.891
Don't touch me.

867
38:08.811 --> 38:09.638
What are you doing?

868
38:11.331 --> 38:12.530
You toss and turn at night.

869
38:12.891 --> 38:13.998
I worry you'll fall off.

870
38:14.210 --> 38:15.650
If I sleep here, I won't worry.

871
38:17.090 --> 38:17.931
Even if you fall,

872
38:18.491 --> 38:19.491
you'll fall into my arms.

873
38:22.411 --> 38:23.130
The floor is cold,

874
38:23.570 --> 38:24.730
and I won't fall off.

875
38:25.291 --> 38:26.371
Go back to the bedroom.

876
38:26.771 --> 38:27.331
Sleep now.

877
38:43.690 --> 38:45.610
(The moment he slept beside my couch,)

878
38:46.730 --> 38:47.690
(I finally realized)

879
38:49.011 --> 38:49.851
(that love)

880
38:51.411 --> 38:52.891
(can truly be faked.)

881
39:03.811 --> 39:04.411
What's wrong?

882
39:04.451 --> 39:05.331
You look so pale.

883
39:06.291 --> 39:07.011
Couldn't sleep?

884
39:07.971 --> 39:08.690
A little.

885
39:09.331 --> 39:10.371
Have some breakfast.

886
39:10.491 --> 39:11.650
Skip the coffee.

887
39:11.690 --> 39:13.011
I'll make you rose tea

888
39:13.011 --> 39:13.530
for soothing.

889
39:17.331 --> 39:18.130
Gosh,

890
39:20.050 --> 39:21.250
your mom got you herbal meds

891
39:21.291 --> 39:22.210
for pregnancy again?

892
39:22.411 --> 39:23.650
She said she went through a lot

893
39:23.650 --> 39:24.411
to get them

894
39:24.570 --> 39:25.690
and insisted I finish them.

895
39:26.090 --> 39:27.170
Haven't you told them yet

896
39:27.210 --> 39:28.291
that the scumbag cheated?

897
39:30.291 --> 39:31.730
If I tell them now,

898
39:32.130 --> 39:33.170
they'll lose their minds.

899
39:34.050 --> 39:34.610
True.

900
39:35.331 --> 39:36.411
Let me throw out these meds

901
39:36.411 --> 39:36.891
for you.

902
39:37.491 --> 39:38.291
Don't throw them.

903
39:38.331 --> 39:39.103
Leave them there.

904
39:39.130 --> 39:40.730
If Di Liren sees them missing,

905
39:41.011 --> 39:42.050
he'll get suspicious.

906
39:44.690 --> 39:45.451
Fine.

907
39:45.771 --> 39:47.411
We'll leave them here just for show.

908
39:52.771 --> 39:53.931
I just feel bad for you.

909
39:54.371 --> 39:55.331
Trying to get pregnant,

910
39:55.610 --> 39:56.771
you've suffered so much.

911
39:57.170 --> 39:58.331
All the pills and shots

912
39:58.371 --> 39:59.530
you took could fill a cart.

913
39:59.690 --> 40:00.170
You even quit

914
40:00.170 --> 40:01.210
your favorite ice cream.

915
40:01.371 --> 40:01.971
Why should you?

916
40:05.451 --> 40:06.891
In fact, when I think about it,

917
40:07.610 --> 40:09.130
I'm already 32.

918
40:09.771 --> 40:10.730
Even if I

919
40:10.771 --> 40:12.130
divorce Di Liren this year,

920
40:12.210 --> 40:13.090
take time to recover,

921
40:13.291 --> 40:14.170
and find someone new,

922
40:14.650 --> 40:15.730
from dating

923
40:15.771 --> 40:17.250
to marriage and pregnancy,

924
40:17.411 --> 40:18.650
it'll take at least a year or two.

925
40:18.771 --> 40:19.650
You need to think hard

926
40:19.650 --> 40:20.690
