932
40:27.130 --> 40:27.971
No way.

933
40:28.331 --> 40:29.011
He can get lost.

934
40:29.610 --> 40:30.090
How could I

935
40:30.130 --> 40:31.291
have a baby with a scumbag?

936
40:33.451 --> 40:34.690
I just suddenly realized

937
40:35.650 --> 40:36.371
this divorce

938
40:37.530 --> 40:39.170
is going to take a huge toll.

939
40:39.851 --> 40:40.971
Not just on me.

940
40:41.530 --> 40:42.851
Even my parents, Jiali...

941
40:43.291 --> 40:43.931
Our entire family

942
40:43.931 --> 40:45.250
will be heavily affected.

943
40:47.971 --> 40:48.771
Now, I must

944
40:48.811 --> 40:49.891
think it through carefully

945
40:50.411 --> 40:51.170
about how exactly

946
40:51.811 --> 40:53.250
I should get divorced.

947
40:53.530 --> 40:54.851
Either way, he cheated.

948
40:54.971 --> 40:55.971
He's in the wrong.

949
40:56.530 --> 40:57.610
He's the at-fault party.

950
40:59.891 --> 41:00.491
But we still

951
41:00.491 --> 41:01.530
have no concrete evidence.

952
41:11.730 --> 41:12.610
Well, the evidence

953
41:13.130 --> 41:14.210
just walked right in.

954
41:16.840 --> 41:19.048
(Mistress)

955
41:32.451 --> 41:33.090
Tell me.

956
41:33.971 --> 41:34.931
What do you want?

957
41:35.170 --> 41:36.050
I want to be

958
41:37.530 --> 41:38.331
the CFO.

959
41:39.730 --> 41:40.730
With my abilities,

960
41:41.451 --> 41:42.291
I've obtained

961
41:42.331 --> 41:43.891
every accounting certification

962
41:44.170 --> 41:45.050
that can be earned.

963
41:45.331 --> 41:46.210
But knowing knowledge

964
41:46.250 --> 41:47.851
is far from enough.

965
41:48.891 --> 41:50.371
I've been studying in depth

966
41:50.491 --> 41:52.170
Jiali's business model,

967
41:52.411 --> 41:54.090
strategic planning, management,

968
41:54.130 --> 41:55.291
and operational details.

969
41:55.811 --> 41:56.811
The notes I took

970
41:57.491 --> 41:58.931
fill several briefcases.

971
41:59.451 --> 42:01.210
I've been pushing hard

972
42:01.250 --> 42:02.771
toward my goal,

973
42:03.130 --> 42:04.050
building my strength.

974
42:04.371 --> 42:05.371
I just need a chance.

975
42:06.610 --> 42:07.371
What a pity.

976
42:08.210 --> 42:09.331
Di Liren

977
42:09.931 --> 42:11.090
isn't a fool.

978
42:12.050 --> 42:12.811
He knows

979
42:12.851 --> 42:14.130
money from resources.

980
42:15.011 --> 42:16.011
He won't give it to you.

981
42:16.291 --> 42:17.331
So now I've come

982
42:17.811 --> 42:18.650
to my senses.

983
42:30.491 --> 42:31.250
It's Di Liren.

984
42:35.400 --> 42:38.184
=The Vanishing Beauty= (Next Episode Preview)

985
42:40.971 --> 42:41.851
Ready to work with me?

986
42:42.931 --> 42:43.848
Show me your sincerity.

987
42:43.848 --> 42:45.416
