990
42:51.811 --> 42:52.451
Shut up!

991
42:53.411 --> 42:54.891
Stop! Stop! Stop!

992
42:55.050 --> 42:55.690
Stop!

993
42:55.971 --> 42:56.530
Drive!

994
42:56.811 --> 42:57.451
Step on it! Go!

995
42:58.011 --> 42:59.050
Here's my loyalty to you.

996
42:59.451 --> 43:00.570
I went to the flower shop.

997
43:00.771 --> 43:01.610
The sender's address

998
43:02.130 --> 43:02.971
